On 15 January 2026,  [LINK: (Wikipedia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:About]  celebrated the 25th anniversary of its founding in 2001. The English edition has grown to include more than 7 million articles—all written collaboratively by volunteers.

