# HAPPY BELATED BIRTHDAY WIKI! #

Happy Belated birthday Wikipedia. I can't believe it's been 25 years since your creation. You've helped me through so many procrastination sessions and sleepless nights providing me with such a wealth of knowledge and information. Truthfully, I do not use your pages with the same voracity that I did back when I was in school - no big thanks to my hs teachers - but I strongly believe what you stood for and still stand for: providing a place where all knowledge is accessible to all should be protected. Your birthday celebration is happening in LA today Jan 24th, but I won't be able to make it. I will however be there in spirit and start giving back to you for all the times you had given to me. Here's to you Wikipedia and the thousands and thousands of people who brought this vision to life and made it what it is today. Keep inspiring us to be curious and to look deeper. <3<3  [LINK: (~2026-52566-6) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:Contributions/~2026-52566-6]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=User_talk:~2026-52566-6&action=edit&redlink=1] )  [LINK: (19:27, 24 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:25th_anniversary#c-~2026-52566-6-20260124192700-Happy_Belated_Birthday_Wiki!] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:25th_anniversary] ]


