# HAPPIEST OF HAPPY BIRTHDAYS, WIKIPEDIA! #

Happy 25th birthday, Wikipedia! Wikipedia has meant the world to me for so many years. For more than a decade, I have been an editor, but I reached my 1,000th edit in 2020 and I have exponentially increased my contributions since. Moreover, I am a true addict of the website, having spent thousands of hours to learn here. There is nowhere on earth that prizes education as much as Wikipedia, a place that not only educates but has brought about such a wonderful community. I am so grateful for these twenty-five years of Wikipedia, and I cannot wait for twenty-five more.  [LINK: (PickleG13) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:PickleG13]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:PickleG13] )  [LINK: (23:56, 25 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:25th_anniversary#c-PickleG13-20260125235600-Happiest_of_Happy_Birthdays,_Wikipedia!] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:25th_anniversary] ]


