# "MERRY BERDTHDEI!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!I" #

"Merry Berdthdei!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!i" is a phrase created by a random user who dropped in on January 28, 2026,  13 days after Wikipedia's 25th birthday. It is unknown as to the true origins of the phrase, but it is generally believed to be created out of boredom, Tomato sauce, and the video titled Berdthday boy by youtuber an0nymooose.

This strange phenomenon may be attributed to the recipe of a  [LINK: (sponge cake) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sponge_cake] . Nobody knows why the quote is reported to "give you up".  [LINK: (~2026-62096-9) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:Contributions/~2026-62096-9]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=User_talk:~2026-62096-9&action=edit&redlink=1] )  [LINK: (14:30, 28 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:25th_anniversary#c-~2026-62096-9-20260128143000-"Merry_Berdthdei!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:25th_anniversary] ]


