# HAPPY BIRTHDAY FROM A FRENCHIE, WIKIPEDIA! #

How did we live before you ? When the web became mainstream we put so much hope in so many plateforms. Saying most disappointed us on a human level is an understatement but thanks to your founder and many hardworking wolunteers you stayed strong, just and free. So thank you. so much. I wish I could participate financially at a higher level as I use you everyday. So many people forget that free stuff cost money and take them for granted. I don't. I just can't help much. Thank you Wikipedia, thank you to your founders and contributors, checkers, correctors, etc, from the bottom of my heart.  [LINK: (~2026-62293-7) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:Contributions/~2026-62293-7]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=User_talk:~2026-62293-7&action=edit&redlink=1] )  [LINK: (03:07, 29 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:25th_anniversary#c-~2026-62293-7-20260129030700-Happy_Birthday_from_a_Frenchie,_Wikipedia!] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:25th_anniversary] ]


